  "title": "Vegan Mexican Quinoa Bowl with Green Chile Cilantro Sauce",
  "description": "Quinoa, lettuce, avocados, and black beans are layered in these easy vegan bowls topped with a Mexican-inspired green chile cilantro sauce.",
